when you do the Changeling Way. The benefit outside moral tranquility is reliability, since you don't have to seek a new body.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see, thank you for clarifying it. C20 was kind of vague on those details, according to my memory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-16T00:16:28-07:00","id":1564783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1564416-protection-against-fae?p=1564779#post1564779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Hsien were originally glorious, fully divine spirits living in the heavens. During the mythical <b>Age of Legends</b>, they messed up. They grew arrogant, neglected their duties, and mismanaged the mortal world. As punishment, the <b>August Personage of Jade</b> stripped them of their true divine forms. They were <b>exiled to Earth</b> (and learned to hide in human flesh (<i>hotei</i>) to survive).</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Sun Wukong:</b> <i>&quot;Skill issue!&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedr